@startuml
!theme superhero-outline

title 娇颜颂 · Stripe 面诊费支付完整流程

actor 用户 as User
participant "Flutter App" as App
participant "订单/支付 API" as API
participant "支付编排服务" as PaymentService
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "Stripe API" as Stripe
participant "Stripe Hosted Checkout" as Checkout
participant "Stripe Webhook" as Webhook
participant "补偿/对账任务" as Reconciliation

== 1. 用户发起面诊费支付 ==

User -> App: 点击“支付面诊费”
App -> API: POST /api/orders/{orderId}/payment-attempts\nIdempotency-Key: [稳定随机值]\npaymentType=CONSULTATION_FEE\nprovider=STRIPE\npaymentMethod=CARD
API -> PaymentService: 创建支付尝试
PaymentService -> DB: 锁定并读取订单

alt 订单不存在或不属于当前用户
  DB --> PaymentService: 校验失败
  PaymentService --> App: 404/403
  App --> User: 显示订单不可支付
else 订单不是 PENDING_PAYMENT
  DB --> PaymentService: 当前状态不允许支付面诊费
  PaymentService --> App: 业务错误
  App --> User: 刷新订单状态
else 已有同阶段成功支付
  DB --> PaymentService: 返回已成功的 payment
  PaymentService --> App: SUCCEEDED
  App --> User: 显示面诊费已支付
else 已有同阶段有效支付尝试
  DB --> PaymentService: 返回原 payment
  PaymentService --> App: 原状态和 Checkout URL
else 可以创建新支付尝试
  PaymentService -> DB: 写入 payment\nstatus=CREATED\ntype=CONSULTATION_FEE\ncurrency=USD\namount=consultationFeeMinor
  DB --> PaymentService: paymentId
end

== 2. 服务端创建 Stripe Checkout Session ==

PaymentService -> Stripe: POST /v1/checkout/sessions\nmode=payment\npayment_method_types[]=card\ncurrency=usd\nunit_amount=consultationFeeMinor\nmetadata: paymentId/orderId/paymentType\nIdempotency-Key: [稳定渠道键]

alt Stripe 明确拒绝请求
  Stripe --> PaymentService: 4xx + error
  PaymentService -> DB: payment=FAILED\n保存脱敏错误码
  PaymentService --> App: 支付创建失败
  App --> User: 显示可理解的失败信息
else 网络超时，结果未知
  Stripe ->x PaymentService: 响应丢失
  PaymentService -> DB: payment=PROCESSING\n禁止生成重复支付
  PaymentService --> App: 支付状态确认中
  App --> User: 显示“正在确认”
else 创建成功
  Stripe --> PaymentService: Checkout Session ID + HTTPS URL
  PaymentService -> DB: payment=REQUIRES_ACTION\n保存 Session ID/过期时间
  PaymentService --> App: nextAction=REDIRECT
end

== 3. App 打开 Stripe 托管支付页 ==

App -> App: 校验 HTTPS 与 checkout.stripe.com 白名单

alt URL 不合法或无法打开
  App --> User: 显示无法打开支付页\n订单资金状态不变
else URL 合法
  App -> Checkout: 使用系统浏览器打开 Checkout URL
  Checkout --> User: 展示 USD 面诊费和银行卡表单
  User -> Checkout: 输入银行卡并确认支付

  alt 需要 3DS
    Checkout --> User: 展示银行身份验证
    User -> Checkout: 完成或取消验证
  end

  alt 卡片被拒绝/3DS 失败
    Checkout --> User: 显示失败，可在 Session 内重试
  else 用户主动取消
    Checkout --> App: 跳转 cancel_url
    App -> API: 查询本地支付状态
    API --> App: REQUIRES_ACTION/EXPIRED
    App --> User: 显示未完成支付
  else Stripe 接受付款
    Checkout -> Stripe: 完成 PaymentIntent
    par 浏览器返回
      Checkout --> App: 跳转 success_url\n携带 Checkout Session ID
      App -> API: GET /api/payments/{paymentId}?refresh=true
    and 异步通知
      Stripe -> Webhook: checkout.session.completed\nStripe-Signature + 原始请求体
    end
  end
end

== 4. Webhook 确认资金事实 ==

Webhook -> Webhook: 使用原始请求体验签\n校验时间窗、事件类型和 livemode

alt 签名错误或事件来自错误模式
  Webhook --> Stripe: HTTP 400
  note right of Webhook
    不写有效事件，
    不推进支付或订单。
  end note
else 签名有效
  Webhook -> DB: 按 provider + eventId 防重入库

  alt 事件已经处理
    DB --> Webhook: 返回原事件
    Webhook --> Stripe: HTTP 200
  else 首次处理
    Webhook -> DB: 锁定 payment 和 order\n核对 Session ID/paymentId\nprovider=STRIPE\ntype=CONSULTATION_FEE\ncurrency=USD\namount=consultationFeeMinor

    alt payment_status != paid
      Webhook -> DB: 保存 PROCESSING/FAILED/EXPIRED
      Webhook --> Stripe: HTTP 200
    else 金额、币种、阶段或订单状态不一致
      Webhook -> DB: event=FAILED/NEEDS_REVIEW
      Webhook --> Stripe: HTTP 503
      note right of DB
        不推进订单，进入告警、
        重试或人工核账。
      end note
    else 校验全部通过
      Webhook -> DB: payment=SUCCEEDED\npaidAt=now
      Webhook -> DB: order=CONSULTATION_PAID\npaidAmountMinor=consultationFeeMinor
      Webhook -> DB: 写订单状态日志
      Webhook -> DB: event=PROCESSED
      Webhook --> Stripe: HTTP 200
    end
  end
end

== 5. App 展示最终结果 ==

API -> Stripe: 必要时查询 Checkout Session
Stripe --> API: payment_status
API -> DB: 使用相同校验规则收敛本地状态
API --> App: 服务端可信支付状态

alt SUCCEEDED
  App --> User: 显示“面诊费支付成功”\n订单进入“面诊费已付，等待到店”
else REQUIRES_ACTION
  App --> User: 显示“支付尚未完成”\n允许继续原 Checkout
else PROCESSING
  App --> User: 显示“支付确认中”\n允许离开页面后再查询
else FAILED/CANCELLED/EXPIRED
  App --> User: 显示失败或已取消\n允许创建新的支付尝试
end

== 6. 延迟通知与故障补偿 ==

Reconciliation -> DB: 扫描超时 PROCESSING 支付\n和 FAILED Webhook 事件
Reconciliation -> Stripe: 查询 Checkout Session
Stripe --> Reconciliation: 当前权威状态
Reconciliation -> DB: 幂等更新 payment/event/order

alt 后续确认 paid
  Reconciliation -> DB: 推进至 SUCCEEDED\n订单进入 CONSULTATION_PAID
else Session 已过期
  Reconciliation -> DB: payment=EXPIRED
else 多次重试仍无法收敛
  Reconciliation -> DB: 标记 NEEDS_REVIEW 并告警
end

note over User, Reconciliation
  核心规则：成功页不是收款凭证；只有已验签 Webhook或服务端查询 Stripe 得到 paid，
  且金额、USD 币种、面诊费阶段和订单状态全部匹配，才能确认面诊费支付成功。
end note

@enduml
